T*
(Supervised learning maps inputs X to outputs y using a training set.) Tj
T*
(The loss function measures how wrong a prediction is; training means) Tj
T*
(minimizing average loss over the training data. Gradient descent) Tj
T*
(repeatedly steps the parameters in the direction opposite the) Tj
T*
(gradient, with the learning rate controlling the step size.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If the learning rate is too large the loss oscillates or diverges;) Tj
T*
(if it is too small training is needlessly slow. A common compromise) Tj
T*
(is a decaying learning rate or an adaptive optimizer such as Adam.) Tj
