(Evaluation Metrics) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For binary classification, precision is the fraction of predicted) Tj
T*
(positives that are truly positive, while recall is the fraction of) Tj
T*
(actual positives that were found. The F1 score is the harmonic mean) Tj
T*
(of precision and recall and is preferred when classes are imbalanced.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Accuracy alone can be misleading: with 99 percent negatives a model) Tj
T*
(that always predicts negative has 99 percent accuracy but zero) Tj
T*
(recall. For the exam, be able to derive a confusion matrix from a) Tj
T*
(list of predictions and compute all four metrics by hand.) Tj
T*
